h the  update the active noise cancellation is  a lot worse the plane is noticeably  louder and the new airpods Pro 2 that he  got were a lot quieter another person  usually didn't hear his Roomba Vacuum  but now it is noticeable and Audible and  even though he doesn't have the airpod  pros too his original Pros have also  gotten noticeably worse from the update  that was also Auto installed the day the  new ones launched I think this is quite  Shady even though these perform great it  is really weird to see that other  products that were good before got worse  now I don't know if that's just to prop  up these new ones or there's new airpods  Max coming out or what is going on but  that should not be happening so now I'm  thinking why do I even need the airpods  max they do sound better overall but  these still sound so fantastic these are  less convenient the active noise  cancellation Works worse while these  airpod Pros 2 are less than half the  price honestly I don't know when I'm  gonna use the airpods max maybe when I  need to have it wired to a computer but  with that delay latency on these new  airpods Pros too are better they switch  super fast from device to device if they  don't auto switch you click it it's done  the previous air pods like my threes  those took quite a bit longer and to  have Precision tracking to be able to  find them when you lose them I only had  that happen one time when they fell into  my couch it is so stress relieving to be  guided to the right spot to be able to  have the little light go off the speaker  in the case to start playing it is just  so nice that that little extra will save  you from losing them having to buy  another pair overall I think these are  the ultimate earbuds they're not the  best in every category but for the price  they are great and if somebody is  questioning if they should upgrade it is  an absolute yes for every single  category so I highly recommend them and  I think this might be my favorite  product that Apple launched this  September you guys let me know your  thoughts we have links down below click  above to subscribe if you guys want to  see more videos check out those videos  right over there this has been Max and  I'll see you in the next one  [Music]

